From 418e88034c8cc834ae745691e6f6b26e950618b7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 11:29:13 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] test(motion): pin that a tilted hole is not drilled along
 Z

Holes tilted 2 and 5 degrees in a 10 mm plate drop out of Z and
cross recognition: the Z circle fit over all wall vertices refuses
the sliding section. A thin wall that the fit accepts moves no wall
by more than FIT_TOL.

Refs #3554

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
